  content (ℚ is the coefficient field the `finrank`/`BilinForm` statements are WRITTEN IN,
  the N6/N16/N42/N184/N185 precedent; the OBJECT is the derived complex-unit rung).

  PHYSICS-WORDS-REMOVABLE (docs/STANDARD.md §2). Delete "hypercharge / U(1) / so(2) / phase /
  gauge": what remains is the pure statement that the skew-adjoint operators of the form
  `(v,w) ↦ (v · star w).re` on the 2-dimensional commutative algebra `Dbl ℚ` form a
